                  "type": "Compose",
                  "inputs": "<p>Hello Team,</p>\n<br>\n<p>\nThe automated update of the <strong>Planview</strong> record has been completed successfully. The record is now ready for review and validation prior to submission.\n</p>\n\n<p>\n<strong>Record Information</strong>\n</p>\n\n<ul>\n    <li>\n        <strong>Planview ID: </strong>\n        @{triggerOutputs()?['body/bdgas_planviewid']}\n    </li>\n\n    <li>\n        <strong>Planview Project Name: </strong>\n        <a href=\"@{outputs('Run_a_flow_built_with_Power_Automate_for_desktop')?['body/varPlanviewRecordURL']}\">\n            @{triggerOutputs()?['body/bdgas_digitalproductname']}\n        </a>\n    </li>\n\n    <li>\n        <strong>Request No (ARGO): </strong>\n        @{triggerOutputs()?['body/bdgas_requestintake']}\n    </li>\n\n    <li>\n        <strong>Request Name (ARGO): </strong>\n        @{triggerOutputs()?['body/bdgas_digitalproductname']}\n    </li>\n\n    <li>\n        <strong>Request Intake Link (ARGO): </strong>\n        <a href=\"@{outputs('Compose_Request_Intake_URL')}\">\n            View BOT in ARGO App\n        </a>\n    </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>\nKindly review the record and proceed with the submission if all information has been validated and no further changes are required.\n</p>\n\n<br>\n\n<p>\nThank you.\n</p>\n\n<p>\nBest regards,\n</p>\n<p>\n<strong>ARGO Notification</strong>\n</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#666666;\">\nThis is an automated notification generated by ARGO App. No reply is required. BD Restricted.\n</p>",
